.\" File: man/makefemtofs.8
.\" Created by Andrea "Nemesi" Cocito on 08/11/2026
.\" FemtoFS image builder manual.
.Dd November 8, 2026
.Dt MAKEFEMTOFS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm makefemtofs
.Nd build and verify an immutable FemtoFS image
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Op Cm --
.Ar input output
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility builds one raw FemtoFS image from a directory tree or a non-mtree
archive supported by libarchive.
The input must remain unchanged throughout construction.
Regular-file output is verified before publication;
existing files require explicit replacement authorization.
Output symlinks and output paths inside the input tree are rejected.
.Pp
The image stores ownership and permissions but ignores source ACLs,
extended attributes and file flags.
It stores an image-wide creation time rather than per-file timestamps.
Raw mtree/METALOG input and archives containing no entries are rejected.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--strip-components N"
.It Fl f , Fl -force
Replace an existing regular output file.
.It Fl -device
Authorize destructive output to an existing block or character device.
Implemented only on FreeBSD.
The device must be unmounted, large enough for the image, and have a sector
size dividing 4096.
The image header is committed after image data is written and flushed.
Failure can leave the previous device contents destroyed or invalid.
.It Fl -dry-run
Read input, plan and validate without writing an output image.
Temporary payload spooling may still occur.
.It Fl -strip-components Ar N
Remove
.Ar N
leading archive path components.
Reject a non-directory entry if this removes its entire path.
.It Fl -synthesize-dirs
Create parent directories omitted from an archive.
.It Fl -root-mode Ar octal
Override or supply root directory permissions, at most 07777.
.It Fl -root-uid Ar uid
Override or supply the numeric root directory owner.
.It Fl -root-gid Ar gid
Override or supply the numeric root directory group.
.It Fl -traverse-mounts
Cross filesystem boundaries when reading a directory tree.
By default, do not cross them.
.It Fl -uuid Ar uuid
Use a fixed UUID in canonical 8-4-4-4-12 hexadecimal form.
Otherwise generate a UUID.
Combine with
.Ev SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
and unchanged inputs for reproducible images.
.It Fl -temp-dir Ar directory
Use this directory for temporary payload spooling.
.It Fl -verify Ar mode
Select
.Cm full
(default) or
.Cm structure
verification.
Both check the header, metadata, metadata hash and stored payloads;
.Cm full
also checks the whole-image hash, exact deduplication and zero-filled holes.
.It Fl v , Fl -verbose
Print planning statistics and completion information.
.It Fl V , Fl -version
Print the program and image-format versions, then exit.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print usage, then exit.
.It Cm --
End option processing; subsequent arguments are input and output paths.
.El
.Pp
Options taking values require a separate argument.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
.It Ev SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH
Image creation time in Unix seconds, converted to the format's epoch
of January 1, 2017 UTC.
The value must fit the image timestamp range.
When unset, use the current build time and reject input timestamps later
than build start.
Setting this variable disables that input-time check.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
makefemtofs root-directory root.0fs
makefemtofs root.tar.zst root.0fs
makefemtofs --dry-run --verbose root-directory root.0fs
.Ed
.Pp
Convert a FreeBSD METALOG into an archive carrying payloads first:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
bsdtar -cf root.tar @METALOG
makefemtofs root.tar root.0fs
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr tar 1 ,
.Xr archive 3 ,
.Xr femtofs 5 ,
.Xr femtoctl 8 ,
.Xr mount_femtofs 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Andrea "Nemesi" Cocito
.Sh CAVEATS
Concurrent source modification is not fully detected; use a quiescent tree
or snapshot.
An archive truncated cleanly between entries can be accepted by archive readers.
Verify archive completeness and authenticity separately when required.
Image hashes detect accidental corruption, not malicious modification.
.\" END File: man/makefemtofs.8
